  "Software Details": "Software detaljer",
  "Personalize Your Theme Color With the Theme Customizer module of eCommerceGo, you have full control over your stores appearance. Start by selecting a theme color that aligns with your brand identity. Whether you prefer bold and vibrant hues or subtle and calming shades, this feature allows you to choose from a wide range of colors to make your store visually appealing and unique. By customizing your theme color, you create a consistent and recognizable brand experience for your customers, enhancing their engagement and loyalty.": "Tilpas din temafarve Med Theme Customizer-modulet i eCommerceGo har du fuld kontrol over din butiks udseende. ",
  "View Live Demo": "Se Live Demo",
  "Define Your Border Color": "Definer din kantfarve",
  "Borders play a crucial role in defining the structure and aesthetics of your stores design. The Theme Customizer module enables you to easily customize border colors to match your chosen theme and enhance the visual hierarchy of your content. This feature allows you to make specific elements stand out or blend seamlessly with the overall design, providing a polished and professional look to your store.": "Grænser spiller en afgørende rolle i at definere strukturen og æstetikken i dit butiksdesign. ",
  "Choose Your Theme White Color": "Vælg dit tema hvid farve",
  "For those who prefer a clean and minimalist aesthetic, the Theme Customizer module offers the option to adjust the white color used throughout your theme. This feature allows you to select the perfect shade of white that complements your store’s design, ensuring that your content is clear, readable, and visually appealing. A well-chosen white theme color can give your store a fresh, modern look that appeals to a wide audience.": "For dem, der foretrækker en ren og minimalistisk æstetik, tilbyder Theme Customizer-modulet muligheden for at justere den hvide farve, der bruges i hele dit tema. ",
  "Customize Your Button Color": "Tilpas din knapfarve",
  "Buttons are critical for guiding users through your store, and their color plays a significant role in user experience. With the Theme Customizer module, you can easily change the button colors to ensure they stand out and encourage clicks. Choose colors that complement your theme or make bold choices to draw attention to key actions, such as adding items to a cart or completing a purchase. Customizing button colors helps improve navigation and enhances the overall functionality of your store, making it more user-friendly and visually cohesive.": "Knapper er afgørende for at guide brugerne gennem din butik, og deres farve spiller en væsentlig rolle for brugeroplevelsen. ",
